---
title: "How do micro tasks round-trip with project tasks?"
accTitle: "Task and project round trip"
accDescr: "Promotion turns a hashed micro task into a project task and a NOTES drawer into a Notes heading. Reversal restores the same outline."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 10
    nodeSpacing: 16
    wrappingWidth: 200
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph TASK["Task"]
    direction LR
    TP["`**Parent #task**`"]
    TM["`**## Micro**`"]
    TD["`**NOTES drawer**`"]
    TP --> TM
    TP --> TD
  end
  subgraph PROJ["Project"]
    direction LR
    PP["`**^prj lifecycle**`"]
    PM["`**#task Micro**`"]
    PD["`**## Notes**`"]
    PP --> PM
    PP --> PD
  end
  TM -->|"promote"| PM
  PM -.->|"restore"| TM
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  class TP,TM,TD focus
  class PP,PM,PD outcome
  style TASK fill:none,stroke:#3B78C2
  style PROJ fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
